/Title (It specifically checks if one time series \(Variable X\) is a good predictor for another time series \(Variable Y\). If Variable X's past values significantly improve the prediction of Variable Y's future values \(better than just using Variable Y's own past\), we say that Variable X "Granger-causes" Variable Y.)
/Dest [28 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 33 0 R
/Prev 525 0 R
/Next 973 0 R
>>
endobj
